  "bio": "Toni Caputo, an adept tattoo artist located in Amsterdam, Netherlands, masterfully specializes in a variety of styles including floral, ornamental, Japanese, and abstract. Working out of Inkorporated Amsterdam and Walls and Skin, Toni's impressive skill level is evident in the intricacy and beauty of the tattoos they create. To witness Toni's artistry firsthand or to book a personalized session, reaching out via direct message is encouraged.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Amsterdam, North Holland, Netherlands"
